
---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout path="/contact/" title="Contact and Bug Reports" description="Report problems and suggest improvements for WheelCanvas random wheel and number picker tools.">
<section class="hero"><div class="container"><span class="eyebrow">Feedback</span><h1>Help us make every pick better.</h1><p>Found a bug, confusing result or a missing accessibility feature? We welcome constructive feedback.</p></div></section>
<section class="section"><div class="container article">
<h2>Report an issue</h2>
<p>Please use the <a href="https://github.com/garrison2025/Random-Wheel/issues">WheelCanvas GitHub issue tracker</a> to report bugs or suggestions. Include the affected URL, browser type, steps to reproduce and what you expected to happen. Never post students' names, private lists or personal information publicly.</p>
<h3>What is helpful to report?</h3><p>Unexpected results, mismatched wheel animation, page errors, mobile layout issues, keyboard navigation problems and inaccessible controls all help improve the tool.</p>
<p><a class="primary" href="https://github.com/garrison2025/Random-Wheel/issues">Open GitHub issue tracker</a></p>
</div></section>
</BaseLayout>
